  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider two identical springs each of spring constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> and negligible mass compared to the mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> as shown. Fig. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> shows one of them and Fig. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> shows their series combination. The ratios of time period of oscillation of the two SHM is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is ______.</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest Integer)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6bebcd64-f773-49be-9c84-55ce15fe9005-image.png\" style=\"width: 191px; height: 271px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></p>",
